  unitName: Dark Secret Nelson (EU)
  unitId: 720244
  unitNumber: 7218
  description: "A senior navy officer serving the extremist politician: the Admiral
    is skilled but, above all, loyal to Robespierre. He has served in numerous campaigns,
    climbing little by little up the hierarchy. During one of his battles, he saved
    a young woman who had been attacked by a group of Shapeshifters with dark intentions.
    The two ended up falling in love. However, Nelson was unaware at the time that
    his partner was also a Shapeshifter. Their relationship would, as a result, become
    a dark secret. Although he accepts the orders he\u2019s given, his perspective
    on Shapeshifters might indeed be different from the man under whom he serves."
  summonDesc: "We need to fight against this menace! I\u2019ll follow orders, but..."
  fusionDesc: "You want to know if I have a woman in my life? That\u2019s none of
    your business!"
